<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>BRIDGE | Building Welcoming Communities</title>

<style>
* {
box-sizing: border-box;
margin: 0;
padding: 0;
}

html {
scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
line-height: 1.6;
color: #1f2937;
background: #f8fafc;
}

/* NAVIGATION */

header {
background: white;
padding: 18px 7%;
display: flex;
justify-content: space-between;
align-items: center;
border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
position: sticky;
top: 0;
z-index: 100;
}

.logo {
font-size: 1.7rem;
font-weight: 900;
letter-spacing: 3px;
color: #173b70;
}

nav a {
text-decoration: none;
color: #374151;
margin-left: 20px;
font-weight: 600;
}

nav a:hover {
color: #2563eb;
}

/* HERO */

.hero {
background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eaf3ff, #f8fbff);
padding: 110px 7%;
text-align: center;
}

.hero h1 {
font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);
max-width: 900px;
margin: 0 auto 25px;
color: #173b70;
}

.hero p {
max-width: 750px;
margin: auto;
font-size: 1.2rem;
color: #4b5563;
}

.buttons {
margin-top: 35px;
}

.button {
display: inline-block;
padding: 14px 26px;
margin: 6px;
border-radius: 8px;
text-decoration: none;
font-weight: bold;
background: #2563eb;
color: white;
}

.button:hover {
transform: translateY(-1px);
opacity: 0.9;
}

.button.secondary {
background: white;
color: #2563eb;
border: 2px solid #2563eb;
}

/* GENERAL SECTIONS */

section {
padding: 80px 7%;
max-width: 1200px;
margin: auto;
}

section h2 {
text-align: center;
font-size: 2.2rem;
margin-bottom: 15px;
color: #173b70;
}

.intro {
text-align: center;
max-width: 760px;
margin: 0 auto 45px;
color: #4b5563;
font-size: 1.05rem;
}

/* MISSION */

.mission {
background: white;
max-width: none;
}

.mission-content {
max-width: 800px;
margin: auto;
text-align: center;
}

.mission-content p {
margin-bottom: 18px;
}

/* CARDS */

.cards {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
gap: 22px;
}

.card {
background: white;
padding: 30px;
border-radius: 14px;
box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
}

.card h3 {
margin-bottom: 12px;
color: #173b70;
}

.card p {
color: #4b5563;
}

/* WHY BRIDGE */

.values {
background: #f1f6fc;
max-width: none;
}

/* FUTURE */

.future {
background: white;
max-width: none;
text-align: center;
}

.future-content {
max-width: 800px;
margin: auto;
}

.future-content p {
margin-bottom: 18px;
color: #4b5563;
}

/* CTA */

.cta {
max-width: none;
background: #173b70;
color: white;
text-align: center;
}

.cta h2 {
color: white;
}

.cta p {
max-width: 700px;
margin: 20px auto;
}

/* CONTACT */

.contact {
text-align: center;
}

/* FOOTER */

footer {
background: #111827;
color: white;
text-align: center;
padding: 35px;
}

footer p {
margin: 5px;
}

/* MOBILE */

@media (max-width: 700px) {

header {
flex-direction: column;
gap: 15px;
}

nav {
text-align: center;
}

nav a {
margin: 5px 8px;
display: inline-block;
}

.hero {
padding: 80px 6%;
}

section {
padding: 65px 6%;
}

}

</style>
</head>


<body>


<!-- NAVIGATION -->

<header>

<div class="logo">
BRIDGE
</div>

<nav>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#help">Get Involved</a>
<a href="#resources">Resources</a>
<a href="#future">Our Vision</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

</header>


<!-- HERO -->

<section class="hero">

<h1>
Building Bridges. Welcoming Communities.
</h1>

<p>
BRIDGE is a community initiative connecting people with
meaningful ways to support refugees and build stronger,
more welcoming communities.
</p>

<div class="buttons">

<a href="#help" class="button">
Get Involved
</a>

<a href="#resources" class="button secondary">
Find Ways to Help
</a>

</div>

</section>


<!-- ABOUT -->

<section id="about" class="mission">

<div class="mission-content">

<h2>
Our Mission
</h2>

<p>
BRIDGE exists to connect people, communities, and
organizations so that everyone can discover meaningful
ways to support refugees.
</p>

<p>
We believe that creating welcoming communities is
something we can accomplish together.
</p>

<p>
We're starting in Kansas, but our vision reaches
far beyond one state.
</p>

</div>

</section>


<!-- GET INVOLVED -->

<section id="help">

<h2>
How Can You Help?
</h2>

<p class="intro">
You don't have to be an expert or have a lot of resources
to make a difference. Everyone can contribute something.
</p>


<div class="cards">


<div class="card">

<h3>
🤝 Volunteer
</h3>

<p>
Give your time to community organizations,
events, and projects supporting refugees.
</p>

</div>


<div class="card">

<h3>
📚 Share Your Skills
</h3>

<p>
Share skills such as tutoring, technology,
language support, or other abilities.
</p>

</div>


<div class="card">

<h3>
📦 Donate Items
</h3>

<p>
Find organizations in your area that are
currently collecting needed supplies.
</p>

</div>


<div class="card">

<h3>
📣 Spread Awareness
</h3>

<p>
Share accurate information and help others
discover meaningful ways to get involved.
</p>

</div>


</div>

</section>


<!-- RESOURCES -->

<section id="resources" class="values">

<h2>
Find Ways to Help
</h2>

<p class="intro">
We're building a resource hub to make it easier for people
to find organizations and opportunities in their communities.
</p>


<div class="cards">


<div class="card">

<h3>
📍 Local Opportunities
</h3>

<p>
Discover organizations and community opportunities
near where you live.
</p>

</div>


<div class="card">

<h3>
🌎 Global Opportunities
</h3>

<p>
Explore ways to support refugee communities
beyond your local area.
</p>

</div>


<div class="card">

<h3>
🏢 Organizations
</h3>

<p>
Connect with organizations working to create
welcoming and supportive communities.
</p>

</div>


</div>

</section>


<!-- FUTURE -->

<section id="future" class="future">

<div class="future-content">

<h2>
Starting Local. Thinking Global.
</h2>

<p>
BRIDGE is beginning with a small team and a simple goal:
make it easier for people to find ways to help.
</p>

<p>
As we grow, we hope to connect communities across
Kansas, the United States, and eventually around the world.
</p>

<p>
Our goal is to build bridges between people who want
to help and communities where that help can make a difference.
</p>

</div>

</section>


<!-- CALL TO ACTION -->

<section class="cta">

<h2>
Be Part of the Bridge
</h2>

<p>
Whether you have time, skills, ideas, or simply want to learn,
there is a place for you in building a more welcoming community.
</p>

<a href="#contact" class="button">
Connect With BRIDGE
</a>

</section>


<!-- CONTACT -->

<section id="contact" class="contact">

<h2>
Connect With Us
</h2>

<p class="intro">
Interested in volunteering, sharing an idea, partnering
with BRIDGE, or helping us grow?
</p>

<p>
Email:
<strong>YOUR EMAIL HERE</strong>
</p>

</section>


<!-- FOOTER -->

<footer>

<p>
<strong>BRIDGE</strong>
</p>

<p>
Building Bridges. Welcoming Communities.
</p>

<p>
© 2026 BRIDGE
</p>

</footer>


</body>
</html>
